    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d370">

                <pb facs="0489" n="377" xml:id="pg377"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Dawson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-03-15"><hi rendition="#italic">March 15,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Continue to report by telegraph. It would be deplorable if this outbreak should
                    disturb the ratification of the treaties.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
